headers {
  User-Agent: Scratch-cli/1.0
}

docs {
  The scratchmd CLI surface (`/cli/v1/*`). These routes require a User-Agent that
  identifies a Scratch client — added here at the folder level. The collection's
  inherited `Authorization: API-Token` header still applies (most CLI routes load
  the user from it; the auth initiate/poll routes only need the User-Agent).
}
